# A rule may override `project` (e.g., Convivy/Engineering pages that are
# really platform-meta → utility).
# skip_titles excludes named pages outright.
# Post-migration merges: append the body of a skipped page onto a canonical
# target file under a labeled marker. Used to combine duplicate-titled pages
# into one doc without losing content.
